section.subsection:
As used in this section, "amnesty" means that a seller is not required to pay the following amounts that the seller would otherwise be required to pay:

a tax, fee, or charge under:Title 10, Chapter 1, Part 3, Municipal Energy Sales and Use Tax Act;Title 10, Chapter 1, Part 4, Municipal Telecommunications License Tax Act;
Section 19-6-714;
Section 19-6-805;Chapter 26, Multi-Channel Video or Audio Service Tax Act;Title 69, Chapter 2, Part 4, Prepaid Wireless Telecommunications Service Charges; or
this chapter;
a penalty on a tax, fee, or charge described in Subsection (1)(a); or
interest on a tax, fee, or charge described in Subsection (1)(a).
